      "translations": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "zh": "寧宗即位，趙汝愚首薦熹及陳傅良，有旨赴行在奏事。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "zh": "熹行且辭，除煥章閣待制、侍講，辭，不許。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "zh": "入對，首言：「乃者，太皇太后躬定大策，陛下寅紹丕圖，可謂處之以權，而庶幾不失其正。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "zh": "自頃至今三月矣，或反不能無疑於逆順名實之際，竊為陛下憂之。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "zh": "猶有可諉者，亦曰陛下之心，前日未嘗有求位之計，今日未嘗忘思親之懷，此則所以行權而不失其正之根本也。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "zh": "充未嘗求位之心，以盡負罪引慝之誠，充未嘗忘親之心，以致溫凊定省之禮，而大倫正，大本立矣。」",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "zh": "復面辭待制、侍講，上手劄：「卿經術淵源，正資勸講，次對之職，勿復勞辭，以副朕崇儒重道之意。」",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "zh": "遂拜命。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
